        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.merchantivoryfilm.com/",
          "overview": "The first definitive feature documentary to lend new and compelling perspectives on the partnership, both professional and personal, of director James Ivory, producer Ismail Merchant, and their primary associates, writer Ruth Prawer Jhabvala and composer Richard Robbins. Footage from more than fifty interviews, clips, and archival material gives voice to the family of actors and technicians who helped define Merchant Ivory’s Academy Award-winning work of consummate quality and intelligence. With six Oscar winners among the notable artists participating, these close and often long-term collaborators intimately detail the transformational cinematic creativity and personal and professional drama of the wandering company that left an indelible impact on film culture.",
          "runtime": 111,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "L'histoire du partenariat Merchant- Ivory, avec des entretiens avec James Ivory et de proches collaborateurs détaillant et célébrant leurs expériences en tant que membre de l'entreprise.",
          "runtime": 111,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "NL",
        "iso_639_1": "nl",
        "name": "Nederlands",
        "english_name": "Dutch",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Documentaire die nieuwe en meeslepende perspectieven biedt op de samenwerking, zowel professioneel als persoonlijk, van regisseur James Ivory, producent Ismail Merchant en hun belangrijkste medewerkers, schrijver Ruth Prawer Jhabvala en componist Richard Robbins. Beelden van meer dan vijftig interviews, clips en archiefmateriaal geven een stem aan de familie van acteurs en technici die hebben bijgedragen aan het definiëren van Merchant Ivory's Academy Award-winnende werk van volmaakte kwaliteit en intelligentie. Met zes Oscarwinnaars onder de opmerkelijke deelnemende artiesten, beschrijven deze nauwe en vaak langdurige medewerkers intiem de transformationele filmische creativiteit en het persoonlijke en professionele drama van het rondtrekkende gezelschap dat een onuitwisbare impact heeft gehad op de filmcultuur.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TR",
        "iso_639_1": "tr",
        "name": "Türkçe",
        "english_name": "Turkish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Bu belgesel, yönetmen James Ivory ve yapımcı Ismail Merchant'ın kurduğu efsanevi 'Merchant Ivory' şirketinin hem profesyonel hem de kişisel hikayesine yeni ve kapsamlı bir bakış sunuyor. İkiliye ek olarak, yazar Ruth Prawer Jhabvala ve besteci Richard Robbins gibi kilit isimlerin de merkeze alındığı film, 50'den fazla röportaja ve zengin arşiv görüntülerine yer veriyor. Aralarında altı Oscar ödüllü ismin de bulunduğu oyuncular ve ekip üyeleri, sinema kültüründe silinmez bir iz bırakan bu 'gezgin kumpanyanın' Akademi Ödüllü filmlerinin ardındaki yaratıcı süreci, kişisel ve profesyonel dramaları tüm samimiyetiyle anlatıyor.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
